    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1108">

                <pb facs="1144" n="1134" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1134"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/9–1849: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Shanghai</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-18">September 18,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received September 18—5:01 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3911. SS <hi rendition="#italic">Flying Clipper</hi> from Taku Bar arrived
                    Shanghai September 18, made fast Hongkew-Shanghai wharf 1345 hours. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Flying Independent</hi> from Hong Kong made fast same
                    wharf 1435 hours. Previous message from master to agent stated <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Independent</hi> stopped by Chinese naval craft at mouth
                    Yangtze 1630 local time then given permission proceed. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Clipper</hi> arrived shortly after and proceeded up Yangtze passing <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Independent</hi> en route. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Clipper</hi> apparently cleared also by Chinese naval vessel but no
                    wireless report from master received.</p>
                <p>These first American vessels arrive Shanghai since port closure June 25. Great
                    local interest.</p>
                <p>Repeated CNO for information. Please pass VOANY.<anchor n="71" xml:id="d1108-f1"
                    />
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1108-f1" n="71" xml:id="d1108-f1-content">
                <p>Voice of America, New York.</p>
